rview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Price Club Merger</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-costco-1983/price-club-merger/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Oct 1993 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-costco-1983/price-club-merger/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Costco merges with The Price Company to form PriceCostco.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;price-club-merger&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding:T+3669 days&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;recorded&lt;/strong&gt;: 1993-10-01T00:00:00.000Z&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;segment&lt;/strong&gt;: warehouse-club-formation&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;significance&lt;/strong&gt;: 0.9 · &lt;strong&gt;certainty&lt;/strong&gt;: 0.5&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tags&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;merger&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;growth&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;price-club&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stems from the &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="link link--text" href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/"&gt;Costco Wholesale overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Kirkland Signature Launch</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-costco-1983/kirkland-signature-launch/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Jan 1995 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-costco-1983/kirkland-signature-launch/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Kirkland Signature, the company&amp;rsquo;s own brand, is introduced.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt